EGSA

This distribution contains modifications to SDFStudio and Nerfstudio source
files. SDFStudio and Nerfstudio are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
The original copyright and licence headers in derived source files are retained.

The bundled training source is based on SDFStudio revision
370902a10dbef08cb3fe4391bd3ed1e227b5c165. EGSA adds edge priors, EMA hardness
updates and adaptive feedback, and modifies the pixel sampler, data manager
and training pipeline. Upstream model implementations are retained.

Upstream SDFStudio:
https://github.com/autonomousvision/sdfstudio

The dataset assets are separate works and are subject to the terms stated in
docs/DATASETS.md and in the corresponding GitHub Release.
